OL,3,GNEWSA'Pavements are for pedestrians',
OL,4,Acampaigner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn accessibility advocate has
OL,7,Fcriticised people who park on pavements
OL,8,Fahead of a council consultation on
OL,9,Fproposed restrictions.
OL,11,FCliff Bush, co-chair of the Surrey
OL,12,FCoalition of Disabled People, says
OL,13,Fpavement parking can be "very
OL,14,Fdangerous" for disabled people, school
OL,15,Fchildren and mothers with children if
OL,16,Fthey have to walk in the road.
OL,18,FIt comes as Tandridge District Council
OL,19,Fhas opened a public consultation on a
OL,20,Fproposed Public Spaces Protection Order
OL,21,F(PSPO) for parts of Caterham in a bid
OL,22,Fto improve pavement safety.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
