OL,3,GNEWSA'Pavements are for pedestrians',
OL,4,Acampaigner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed PSPO would ban driving,
OL,7,Friding and parking on pavements within
OL,8,Fthe designated area for three years,
OL,9,Faccording to the local authority.
